# Account API endpoint for the Worker. Without it the game runs exactly as before
# and the account UI says the service is not configured.
#
# Never commit a real URL here if the Worker is private, and never commit a secret
# at all - Vite inlines VITE_* into the bundle, so anything in this file is public.
VITE_ACCOUNT_API=

# Google sign-in. The OAuth *client ID* of the web app you created in Google Cloud
# console. Public by design - it ships in every bundle that uses Google sign-in.
# The matching GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID secret must also be set on the Worker.
# See worker/README.md §Google sign-in.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
